    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like there's no \"good\" version of me to go back to. i look in the mirror and i just see that coward in the hallway. if i can't change who i am, then what's the point of even trying to move forward? it's like i'm just waiting for the world to realize i don't belong here.",
